        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Technologies are Fixed bed and Fluidized bed gasification with equal shares (50%) with respect to the total production volume.\n\n# Included processes\nThis process includes the production of synthetic gas from wood chips, 50% from Fixed bed gasification and 50% from Fluidized bed gasification.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
